{"version":1,"content":"<p>坐擁近百億票房內地女星白百何，與歌手陳羽凡有過一段婚姻，惟白百何被揭與男模張愛朋暢遊泰國，二人更當眾互相上演「一指禪」、捏股等情慾戲碼，終白百何與陳羽凡於2015年就離婚，及後佢同現任老公張思麟低調再婚，2021年被公開育有二胎兒子。</p><p>白百何</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:21:33.442047+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:04:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.757666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.757666+00:00","content_hash":"a1685dc6e0d44318a23c2692b418550651f41bb00aab3feb3e4d0739cccf0b29","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}